{
  "id": "section-store-table",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "id": "section-store-table:p0000",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Store table (d6)\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[51,22,39]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-store-table:p0001",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "1\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[51,39,41]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-store-table:p0002",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "A shot in the dark. You try to loot a store but, as you enter, someone\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[51,41,112]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-store-table:p0003",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "fires a warning shot. Make a L3 Charisma roll to persuade the shooter\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[51,112,182]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-store-table:p0004",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "you mean no harm. Add +1 for Charisma, +2 for Charisma (Expert). If\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[51,182,250]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-store-table:p0005",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "you succeed, the shooter will let you loot the store. If you fail, he will\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[51,250,325]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-store-table:p0006",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "shoot again (defend against L4 or lose 2 Life) and then flee in the\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[51,325,393]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-store-table:p0007",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "shadows. Once he goes, you may loot the store. You may: 1) roll once\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[51,393,462]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-store-table:p0008",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "on the Random Objects table; 2) roll twice on the Useful Stuff table; 3)\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[51,462,535]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-store-table:p0009",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "roll a 2 in 6 chance of finding a specific non-magical item of your choice\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[51,535,610]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-store-table:p0010",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "from any of the tables.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[51,610,634]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-store-table:p0011",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "2\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[51,634,636]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-store-table:p0012",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Food store. You may pick up d6 Food points. However, if you do so,\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[51,636,703]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-store-table:p0013",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "there’s a 3 in 6 chance of an encounter with a random monster. Roll d6\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[51,703,774]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-store-table:p0014",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "to determine on which table to roll: 1 Undead, 2 Beast, 3 Slasher, 4\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[51,774,843]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-store-table:p0015",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Possessed, 5 Demonic horror, 6 Lab Horror. If you do not pick up any\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[51,843,912]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-store-table:p0016",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Food, you avoid the chance of an encounter.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[51,912,956]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-store-table:p0017",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "3\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[51,956,958]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-store-table:p0018",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Armory. There’s a 4 in 6 chance of an encounter with a random\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[51,958,1020]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-store-table:p0019",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "monster. Roll d6 to determine on which table to roll: 1-2 Slasher, 3-4\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[51,1020,1091]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-store-table:p0020",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Undead, 5-6 Possessed. You automatically find d6 ammo for a ranged\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[51,1091,1158]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-store-table:p0021",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "weapon of your choice. In addition, you may roll a 1 in 6 chance of\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[51,1158,1226]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-store-table:p0022",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "finding any weapon on the weapon summary (p. 99) except antique\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[51,1226,1290]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-store-table:p0023",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "weapons, scythes, and chainsaws. Roll once per weapon. If you find a\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[51,1290,1359]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-store-table:p0024",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "weapon that uses ammo, you find 2d6 ammo for it as well.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[51,1359,1416]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-store-table:p0025",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "4 Picked clean. You find nothing here.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[51,1416,1455]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-store-table:p0026",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "5\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[51,1455,1457]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-store-table:p0027",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Bookstore. Roll a 1 in 6 chance of finding an occult guide, 3 in 6 of\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[51,1457,1527]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-store-table:p0028",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "finding a holy book. If neither are found, there is a 2 in 6 chance of\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[51,1527,1598]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-store-table:p0029",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "finding a random book from the Random Books table. If you roll to find\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[51,1598,1669]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-store-table:p0030",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "any books, you must also roll a 3 in 6 chance of random encounter. Roll\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[51,1669,1741]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-store-table:p0031",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "d6, 1-3 Possessed, 4-5 Witch children, 6 Demonic horror, then roll on\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[51,1741,1811]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-store-table:p0032",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "the appropriate table to determine monster type.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[51,1811,1860]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-store-table:p0033",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "6\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[51,1860,1862]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-store-table:p0034",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Hardware Store. This store was raided, but there is still a chance of\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[51,1862,1932]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-store-table:p0035",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "finding something useful. Roll a d6 for each item on this list: 3 in 6\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[51,1932,2003]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-store-table:p0036",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "chance of finding a hammer, 4 in 6 of shotgun with d6 shells, 5 in 6 of\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[51,2003,2075]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-store-table:p0037",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "knife, 1 in 6 insecticide, 3 in 6 axe. No matter what you find, if you\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[51,2075,2146]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-store-table:p0038",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "search the store you must also roll a 2 in 6 chance of a random\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[51,2146,2210]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-store-table:p0039",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "encounter that will happen as soon as you pick up any objects. Roll d6\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[51,2210,2281]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-store-table:p0040",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "to determine on which table to roll: 1 Undead, 2-3 Slasher, 4 Possessed,\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[51,2281,2354]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-store-table:p0041",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "5 Demonic horror, 6 Witch Children.",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[51,2354,2389]]"
    }
  ],
  "sourcePages": [
    51
  ]
}
